        "official_en_sha256": "25d8fcf4387df7581b9eb755fe48656fad7ac17a1f7281de81f2a79a59f536f2"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "だから、レインの考え方と行動力は\r\n本当に魅力的だったの。",
        "official_en": "So when I saw your actions and learned your way of thinking, they felt so novel—so appealing.",
        "real_en": "That’s why I found your way of thinking and the way you acted so captivating."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
