      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ヘスとアルドールとの戦いに身を置いてきたせいで、\r\n私は物事を白か黒かでしか、考えられなくなっていた。",
        "official_en": "Maybe because I fought in the war between Hess and Aldore, I had come to see everything in black and white.",
        "real_en": "Fighting in the war between Hess and Aldore had left me seeing everything in black and white."
