        "official_en_sha256": "dd566474a7a51101f92e4272a1a24d3283c0ca09a8c7f2b537c44842b65b75de"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "レインに興味を持ったのは、\r\nあの常闇の子どもだったから……。",
        "official_en": "Rain, what interested me about you was that you were Umbra’s child.",
        "real_en": "Rain, what interested me about you was that you were Veritas of the Dark’s child."
