      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "精神だけ外に出して、\r\nよくレインのことを見に行ったわ。",
        "official_en": "So I’d send my spirit out wandering, and went to see you often.",
        "real_en": "I would send my spirit outside and often go to see you."
